WEBVTT

00:02:27.702 --> 00:02:30.110
ti vesh ato eshte te shtirem

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:33.321
sikur ato jane rrobat e nje luftetari kung fu-je

00:02:33.321 --> 00:02:36.060
si Li Mu Bai nga ai filmi,

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:40.373
"Tiger i perkulshem, Dragua i fshehur."

00:02:40.373 --> 00:02:45.556
(Muzike)